{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":317520,\"title\":\"The Son of the Golden West\",\"tagline\":\"ROARIN' THROUGH\",\"overview\":\"Tom Hardy (Tom Mix), a pony express rider, is carrying government gold in a coach to Wassatch accompanied by Alice Calhoun (Sharon Lynn) , the daughter of the US telegraph survey station. The gold is to pay for the US Telegraph Survey and it is to be delivered to the survey chief, Jim Calhoun (Thomas Lingham). The coach is attacked by bandits led by the Slade (Duke Lee) and Kane (Mark Hamilton).\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fpJahsAr19bYUYScPTFBkxEX3Pz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xG6oLCMykBpRvRKV8JX86DPEaSm.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":1928,\"runtime\":60,\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Western\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Eugene Forde\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":118343,\"name\":\"Eugene Forde\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1052155,\"name\":\"Tom Mix\",\"character\":\"Tom Hardy\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qTaMWapR1sxjk6mdi3tvRsSMNks.jpg\"},{\"id\":2671354,\"name\":\"Tony the Horse\",\"character\":\"Tony, Tom's Horse\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2eOYsg7eXwlAixXqd1zfpOAQ5rq.jpg\"},{\"id\":141062,\"name\":\"Sharon Lynn\",\"character\":\"Alice Calhoun\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/unEVQ4LeQrQyDsxMVFiJE46j5KW.jpg\"},{\"id\":1291292,\"name\":\"Thomas G. Lingham\",\"character\":\"Jim Calhoun (as Tom Lingham)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fHiisOPULKsLo31I6jb96RinBVd.jpg\"},{\"id\":1079037,\"name\":\"Duke R. Lee\",\"character\":\"Slade\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sUzmA5zcTCEREvqcFdazCePGtD2.jpg\"},{\"id\":951965,\"name\":\"Lee Shumway\",\"character\":\"Tennessee\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AnA5fg9fU5vqbYIauvkhHj6lGqh.jpg\"},{\"id\":1174024,\"name\":\"Fritzi Ridgeway\",\"character\":\"Rita\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qD4P7khRp21uMQQFhHFnE5RX6ef.jpg\"},{\"id\":474632,\"name\":\"Joey Ray\",\"character\":\"Keller\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nGy1HLp4ZGIqXOyLhHwOhMLIwg2.jpg\"},{\"id\":3316912,\"name\":\"Mark Hamilton\",\"character\":\"Kane\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2717372,\"name\":\"Wynn Mace\",\"character\":\"Slade's Henchman\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":698508,\"title\":\"Redeeming Love\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2iu0lBF7sfAioLfSnSJtdKxlms6.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lD8dFIk9wDEvOwZw0RB47e346io.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A young couple's relationship clashes with the harsh realities of the California Gold Rush of 1850. Angel, experiencing love for the first time and facing demons unsurmountable, runs from the new life she doesn't believe she deserves. When Michael sets out to find her, Angel discovers that she indeed has the power to choose the life she wants.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Drama\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21355,\"title\":\"All the Pretty Horses\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6E4E7wYXw1DE2321F2hVNryLSk7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7U6WJ0qri2sACtcGa0wEpM9eAM1.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The year is 1949. A young Texan named John Grady finds himself without a home after his mother sells the ranch where he has spent his entire life. Lured south of the border by the romance of cowboy life and the promise of a fresh start, Cole and his pal embark on an adventure that will test their resilience, define their maturity, and change their lives forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Western\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":506281,\"title\":\"The World to Come\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6GJQXJ96FUbXtB01VXAdp854qOt.jpg\",\"backdrop\